in{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}}$” is true. Indeed,\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}=0\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}+1\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n- Statement “${\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}}$ is a basis of ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$” is false. Since the set is not linearly independent, it can't form a basis.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “$\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$ can be expressed as a linear combination of ${\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}}$” only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186360522 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "89dcded0-192d-5dc2-a345-d0c8cd7c8279" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452161} {:answer/id #uuid "0acd8998-810c-56fc-a900-3b9c96f638fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452162}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0acd8998-810c-56fc-a900-3b9c96f638fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452162} :answer-field/id #uuid "60f00de3-4ecd-537f-97a1-7582b5c7b29f" :answer-field/key "${\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}}$ is a linearly independent set in ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452928} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "130f4da4-bdf5-521c-b8a8-82b18763c80f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/r